<title>USA: Barr Brothers to accept tenders on Wells Hydro.</title>
<headline>Barr Brothers to accept tenders on Wells Hydro.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barr Brothers &amp; Co. said Monday as agent it will be accepting tender offers on the following Douglas County, Wash., P.U.D. #1, Wells Hydroelectric revenue bonds:</p>
<p>Series 1963 4.00 pct due 9/1/18 #259561AVO</p>
<p>Series 1965 3.70 pct due 9/1/18 #259561AU2</p>
<p>Tenders will be accepted 6/4/1997 from 1100 a.m. to 1:00 p.m. Eastern Time for settlement 6/7/1997.</p>
<p>The Authority reserves the right to reject any or all offers. Please contact Bob Zmuidins at 212-363-4090 or fax to 212-269-7637.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
